target/

# Real third-party off-air WSPR recording used by
# tests/wspr_real_off_air_capture.rs -- deliberately not committed (see
# that file's own module doc comment for why and where to get it).
tests/fixtures/*
# codec2_3200's own fixtures ARE committed (abstracted numeric analysis
# features, plus a synthetic-signal waveform -- never real recorded
# speech itself). See tests/fixtures/codec2_3200/README.md.
!tests/fixtures/codec2_3200/
# Same reasoning for codec2_1600 -- a synthesized non-speech signal run
# through plain upstream Codec2's own reference encoder/decoder, never
# real recorded speech. See tests/fixtures/codec2_1600/README.md.
!tests/fixtures/codec2_1600/
# osr_speech IS committed -- real speech, but from the Open Speech
# Repository, whose own stated license explicitly authorizes exactly this
# ("incorporated into web sites or test equipment"), unlike the WSPR
# recording above or the Codec2 team's own donated WAVs (also real but
# kept out of git despite being cleared -- OSR's own license makes that
# extra caution unnecessary here). See tests/fixtures/osr_speech/README.md.
!tests/fixtures/osr_speech/
